  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Elite Spell. Target foe and all adjacent foes take 15...51...60 fire damage. If you have more Energy than target foe, that foe and all adjacent foes take an additional 15...51...60 fire damage and are set on fire for 1...8...10 second[s].",
      "zhTW": "使目標敵人受到 15～60 火焰傷害。若你比目標擁有更多的能量，則該目標將額外受到 15～60 火焰傷害，並且遭受「著火」病症 1～10 秒。此魔法會造成施法者精疲力竭。"
    },
    "pvp": null
